# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
*.egg
dist/
build/
.eggs/

# Secrets (repo root .env holds ANTHROPIC_API — never commit)
.env

# UGT generated output
models/
logs/
results/

# Internal-only docs / not part of the shareable framework surface.
# The per-game integrations name upstream projects and reference upstream repos;
# Dev/ is the historical archive (named games throughout, incl. in filenames) with
# the status ledger as the concrete, named counterpart to the genericized root docs;
# CLAUDE.md is Claude's working guidance for THIS repository, not shareable doc surface.
# All were untracked with `git rm -r --cached` (files remain on disk, internal-only).
CLAUDE.md
Dev/
integrations/

# TASKS.md is a per-project Orchestrator working file (written by /tasklist, consumed
# by /orchestrate). It belongs in each game/project repo, not in the shared framework.
TASKS.md

# (An `!examples/**/TASKS.md` exception used to sit here so the sample games' task
# lists were committed as reference artifacts. Removed 2026-07-27: the sample games
# moved to their own repositories in `7b759b8`, so the rule matched nothing. Their
# TASKS.md files are committed in those repos, where the blanket rule above does not
# apply. Do not re-add this line unless an `examples/` directory comes back.)

# Node (integration harnesses shell out to node). No trailing slash so this also
# catches node_modules symlinks pointing at an upstream game's dependencies.
node_modules

# Godot (kept for any Godot-backed harness under integrations/). `.godot/` is the
# editor/import cache — it is regenerated
# on every headless run and would otherwise re-dirty the tree after each commit,
# which halts /orchestrate (it requires a clean tree before every task). `*.import`
# and export_presets.cfg are machine-local import metadata / export paths.
.godot/
*.import
export_presets.cfg

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
